title: Even or not
golf: 24

Write `is_even(n)` that returns `True` if n is even and `False` if it's odd.
=== starter
def is_even(n):
    ...
=== broken
def is_even(n):
    return n % 2 == 1
=== test
from harness import eq


def test_is_even(sol):
    eq(sol.is_even(4), True, "is_even(4)")
    eq(sol.is_even(7), False, "is_even(7)")
    eq(sol.is_even(0), True, "is_even(0)")
